</p>

      <h2>7. Limitation of Liability
</h2>
      <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, villasgame.com, its owners, or affiliates will not be liable for any incidental, consequential, or special damages.

We do not guarantee any specific results from your use of the website.
</p>

      <h2>8. Termination    
</h2>
      <p>We may suspend or terminate your access to the site at any time for any reason, without notice.

Upon termination, your right to use the site immediately ceases.
</p>

      <h2>9. Changes to Terms
</h2>
      <p>We may modify these Terms at any time.
 
Changes will be effective immediately when posted on the site.

It is your responsibility to review the Terms regularly. Continued use of the site constitutes acceptance of the amended Terms.
</p>

      <h2>10. Governing Law
</h2>
      <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of [Your Country / State].

Any disputes arising out of or related to these Terms or your use of the site will be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of [Your Country / State].
</p>

      <h2>11. Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about these Terms, you can contact us at:
Email: <a href="mailto:your-email@example.com">swatikumari@digigrove.com</a>
Address: Digigrove Digital Private Limited -Plot No. 34, Phase IV, Udyog Vihar, Gurugram, Haryana - 122008, India

</p>
    </article>
  </main>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div class="brand">🔥 VillasGame</div>
      <div class="links">
        <a href="/about">About</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
      </div>
      <div class="copy">© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> ZONTAL. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
      const tag = (e.target && e.target.tagName) || '';
      if (e.key === '/' && tag !== 'INPUT' && tag !== 'TEXTAREA') {
        e.preventDefault();
        document.getElementById('searchInput').focus();
      }
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
